# System Architecture

## Overview

CYSMIC Subsurface OS is an agent-first petroleum engineering platform that enables engineers to accomplish work through natural conversation with AI agents that spawn interactive UI components on-demand.

## High-Level Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Client["Frontend (React + Vite + TypeScript)"]
        UI[UI Components<br/>shadcn/ui + Tailwind]
        Chat[Chat Interface<br/>Agent Scaffolding]
        Cards[Card System<br/>Registry + Renderer]
        Store[State Management<br/>Zustand + React Query]
        IDB[IndexedDB<br/>Offline Storage]
    end

    subgraph Gateway["API Gateway / WebSocket"]
        WS[Socket.IO<br/>Real-time]
        Auth[JWT Auth<br/>Rate Limiting]
    end

    subgraph Backend["Backend (FastAPI + Python)"]
        API[REST API<br/>FastAPI]
        Agents[Agent Orchestration<br/>Multi-model LLM]
        WSHandler[WebSocket<br/>Handler]
    end

    subgraph Data["Data Layer"]
        PG[(PostgreSQL<br/>+ pgvector)]
        Redis[(Redis 7+<br/>Cache + Queue)]
        Celery[Celery<br/>Background Jobs]
    end

    subgraph Services["Core Services"]
        FileIng[File Ingestion<br/>LAS/DLIS/CSV/Petrel]
        DCA[Analysis Engine<br/>DCA/Volumetrics/MB]
        Memory[Agent Memory<br/>Preferences + History]
        Reasoning[Reasoning Trace<br/>Explainability]
    end

    subgraph External["External Integrations"]
        Petrel[Petrel]
        Eclipse[Eclipse]
        Kappa[Kappa]
    end

    Client --> Gateway
    Gateway --> Backend
    Backend --> Data
    Backend --> Services
    Backend --> External
    Cards <--> |Sync| Backend
    Store <--> |Cache| Redis
    UI <--> |Offline| IDB
```

## Component Architecture

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph Frontend["React Frontend"]
        Chat[Chat Interface] --> |Spawns| Cards
        Cards --> |State| Store
        Store --> |Query| API
        API --> |Real-time| WS
    end

    subgraph CardSystem["Card System"]
        Types[Card Types<br/>6 Implemented]
        Registry[Card Registry<br/>Registration]
        Renderer[Card Renderer<br/>Dynamic Render]
        State[Card State<br/>useCardState]
    end

    Cards --> Types
    Cards --> Registry
    Cards --> Renderer
    Cards --> State
```

## Data Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Chat
    participant Agent
    participant Cards
    participant API
    participant DB

    User->>Chat: Send message
    Chat->>Agent: Forward to agent
    Agent->>Agent: Process with LLM
    Agent->>Agent: Decide on cards to spawn
    Agent->>Cards: Return card definitions
    Cards->>Cards: Register & render
    Cards->>API: Request data
    API->>DB: Query PostgreSQL
    API-->>Cards: Return data
    Cards-->>User: Display UI
```

## Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology | Purpose |
|-------|------------|---------|
| Frontend | React 18+ | UI Framework |
| Build | Vite | Development & Build |
| Styling | TailwindCSS + shadcn/ui | Design System |
| State | Zustand | Client State |
| Data Fetching | TanStack Query | Server State |
| Charts | Recharts, Plotly | Visualizations |
| Backend | FastAPI | REST API + WebSocket |
| Database | PostgreSQL 15+ | Primary Storage |
| Vector DB | pgvector | Semantic Search |
| Cache | Redis 7+ | Caching + Session |
| Queue | Celery | Background Jobs |
| File Parsing | lasio, dlisio | Petroleum Formats |
| ML/Analysis | NumPy, SciPy, pandas | Engineering Calc |

## Implemented Card Types

1. **FileIngestionCard** - LAS/DLIS/CSV/Petrel file upload
2. **DeclineCurveCard** - DCA visualization & analysis
3. **VolumetricsCard** - STOIIP/OOIP calculations
4. **WellTestCard** - Pressure transient analysis
5. **MaterialBalanceCard** - Material balance calculations
6. **ReportBuilderCard** - Report generation

